### Phase 2: Database Models (SQLAlchemy ORM)

Port all 12 tables to SQLAlchemy models with these **schema improvements**:

#### [NEW] [user.py](finance_app/app/models/user.py)
- Add `password_hash` (nullable — for email/password users)
- Add `google_id` (nullable — for OAuth users)
- Add `avatar_url` (nullable — from Google profile)
- Add `preferred_currency` (default `'PKR'`)
- Add `is_active` (boolean, for account deactivation)
- Implement `UserMixin` from Flask-Login
- Password hashing via `werkzeug.security`

#### [NEW] [account.py](finance_app/app/models/account.py)
- Same as existing schema
- Add `is_deleted` (boolean) + `deleted_at` (timestamp) for soft delete
- Add `balance` as a hybrid property (computed from transactions)

#### [NEW] [category.py](finance_app/app/models/category.py)
- Add `user_id` foreign key (nullable — `NULL` = global/system category)
- Add `is_default` boolean flag for system-seeded categories
- Add `icon` field (emoji or icon class name for UI)

#### [NEW] [transaction.py](finance_app/app/models/transaction.py)
- Same as existing schema
- Add `is_deleted` + `deleted_at` for soft delete
- Add `currency` field (default from user's preferred currency)
- Add `exchange_rate` field (rate at time of transaction, for multi-currency)
- Add relationship to tags via `transaction_tags` association table

#### [NEW] [transfer.py](finance_app/app/models/transfer.py)
- Same as existing schema
- Add `notes` field for transfer descriptions

#### [NEW] [budget.py](finance_app/app/models/budget.py)
- Same as existing schema
- Add `alert_threshold` (decimal, default 0.8 — alert at 80% spent)
- Add `alert_sent` (boolean — prevent duplicate emails)

#### [NEW] [savings_goal.py](finance_app/app/models/savings_goal.py)
- Same as existing schema
- Add `is_deleted` + `deleted_at` for soft delete
- Add `contributions` relationship (new table for tracking individual contributions)

#### [NEW] [investment.py](finance_app/app/models/investment.py)
- Same as existing schema
- Add `currency` field
- Add `sold_date` and `sold_amount` (nullable — for tracking realized gains)

#### [NEW] [recurring.py](finance_app/app/models/recurring.py)
- Same as existing schema
- Add `is_active` (boolean — to pause recurring transactions)
- Add `last_processed_date` (track when it was last auto-created)

#### [NEW] [tag.py](finance_app/app/models/tag.py)
- Add `user_id` foreign key (per-user tags)
- Add `color` field (hex color for UI display)

#### [NEW] [audit_log.py](finance_app/app/models/audit_log.py)
- Same as existing schema
- Add `user_id` foreign key (who performed the action)
- Add `old_value` and `new_value` (JSON fields for change tracking)

#### New Tables

| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `savings_contributions` | Track individual deposits to savings goals (amount, date, source account) |
| `exchange_rates` | Cache exchange rates locally (base_currency, target_currency, rate, fetched_at) |
| `notifications` | Store notification history (user_id, type, message, is_read, created_at) |

